<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">scratch</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600">
    An inventory of the music you own — vinyl, CD and digital — in one place.
  </p>

  <dl class="mt-8 divide-y divide-neutral-200 border-y border-neutral-200 text-sm">
    <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-3">
      <dt class="text-neutral-500">Library path</dt>
      <dd class="text-right"><code><%= @library_path %></code></dd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-3">
      <dt class="text-neutral-500">Writable</dt>
      <dd class="text-right">
        <% if @library_writable %>
          <span class="text-red-700">yes — the library should be mounted read-only</span>
        <% else %>
          <span class="text-green-700">no (read-only, as intended)</span>
        <% end %>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-3">
      <dt class="text-neutral-500">Readable</dt>
      <dd class="text-right">
        <% if @library_readable %>
          <span class="text-green-700">yes</span>
        <% else %>
          <span class="text-red-700">no — check the mount and MUSIC_LIBRARY_PATH</span>
        <% end %>
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-neutral-500">
    Nothing is catalogued yet. The scanner arrives in the next phase.
  </p>
</div>
